---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/astro/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CellularProgressSummary from '../../components/astro/CellularProgressSummary.astro';
import CrossRatAtlas from '../../components/cellular/CrossRatAtlas';
import { cellularLessonHref, cellularSections, cellularLessonCount } from '../../data/cellular';

const lessons = await getCollection('cellularLesson', ({ data }) => data.status === 'ready');
---

<BaseLayout title="3GPP·PAMiD 학습 지도" description="GSM·LTE·NR uplink waveform에서 PAMiD state와 DVT 진단까지 연결하는 57개 질문" currentPath="/cellular/">
  <main class="page-shell cellular-hub" data-pagefind-body>
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'RF Wiki', href: '/' }, { label: '3GPP·PAMiD' }]} />
    <header class="page-heading cellular-hub__heading">
      <p class="context-line"><span>3GPP Release 17</span><span>UE uplink·PUSCH</span><span>Module nominal DVT</span><span>{cellularLessonCount}개 질문</span></p>
      <h1>파형 구조에서 PAMiD fail stage까지 한 경로로 읽습니다.</h1>
      <p>GSM·LTE·NR의 시간·주파수·변조 구조를 보고 어떤 module state가 필요한지, 측정 이상이 source부터 analyzer 중 어디서 시작됐는지 역추적합니다.</p>
    </header>

    <CellularProgressSummary lessons={lessons} label="3GPP·PAMiD 전체 진도" />

    <section aria-labelledby="cellular-atlas-heading">
      <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="cellular-atlas-heading">세 무선 규격 구조 비교</h2>
      <CrossRatAtlas client:visible />
    </section>

    <section class="cellular-section-index" aria-labelledby="cellular-section-index-title">
      <header><p class="data-label">6 sections · 57 questions</p><h2 id="cellular-section-index-title">먼저 구조를 그리고, 마지막에 증상에서 거꾸로 올라갑니다.</h2></header>
      <ol>
        {cellularSections.map((section) => {
          const sectionLessons = lessons.filter(({ data }) => data.section === section.id).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
          const first = sectionLessons[0];
          return (
            <li>
              <span class="cellular-section-index__number">{section.index}</span>
              <div>
                <p>{section.context}</p>
                <h3><a href={`/cellular/${section.id}/`}>{section.title}</a></h3>
                <strong>{section.question}</strong>
                <p>{section.description}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="cellular-section-index__action">
                <span>{section.count}개</span>
                {first && <a href={cellularLessonHref(section.id, first.data.slug)}>첫 질문 →</a>}
              </div>
            </li>
          );
        })}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <aside class="cellular-scope-note">
      <p class="data-label">Scope boundary</p>
      <h2>교육용 구조·계산 모델이며 certification 판정을 대신하지 않습니다.</h2>
      <p>Single-carrier UE uplink와 nominal RF DVT를 다룹니다. WCDMA, CA/EN-DC, UL MIMO, FR2/OTA, propagation, PVT/VSWR/reliability, 실제 PAMiD register map과 신규 SCPI 자동화는 포함하지 않습니다.</p>
    </aside>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
